NOT NULL as in the V001–V017 scripts. White box = parent table of another area or part, key only.&lt;br&gt;Crow's foot: child end O&amp;lt; or O| (unique FK = one-to-one); parent end | (NOT NULL FK) or O| (nullable FK). Audit columns pointing to app_user are not drawn." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#94a3b8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="936" width="1162" height="54" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="A3 (1 of 2) · Production logs, box events and crabs" id="A3__1_of_2____Production_logs__box_events_and_crabs"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" value="&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.3.3 (1/2) – Physical Database Design: Production, evidence &amp; alerts — Production logs, box events and crabs&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4 · crow's foot · 7 tables + 7 parent tables of other areas or parts (white, key only) · lines start at the foreign-key column&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;overflow=visible;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="984" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="&lt;b&gt;production_log&lt;/b&gt;" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=26;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=0;marginBottom=0;html=1;fillColor=#e0f2fe;strokeColor=#0369a1;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;startSize=28;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="932" y="362" width="320" height="3